OL,3,GNEWSACMAT joins Philomena Begley on
OL,4,Astage in surprise appearance
OL,5,
OL,6,FIrish star CMAT made a surprise
OL,7,Fappearance at an award ceremony in
OL,8,FBelfast on Wednesday.
OL,10,FThe pop-star joined Philomena Begley,
OL,11,Fone of Irish country music's most loved
OL,12,Fand celebrated entertainers, on stage
OL,13,Fat the NI Music Prize.
OL,15,FBegley was honoured with the Lifetime
OL,16,FAchievement Award in recognition of her
OL,17,F64-year career.
OL,19,FThe country music legend performed the
OL,20,Fhit Blanket on the Ground alongside
OL,21,FCMAT.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
